============================================

Clearly distinguish:

ORDINARY USAGE

The normal literal meaning.

FIGURATIVE USAGE

Meaning that is not intended literally.

IDIOMATIC USAGE

A conventional expression whose meaning may not be predictable from the individual words.

Teach:

* literal interpretation
* figurative interpretation
* idiomatic interpretation
* context
* register
